    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a dog. Your entire purpose in life is herding sheep. Other players are also dogs. They also want to herd sheep. They want to herd more sheep than you. <i>You will not let that happen.\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wiz-Herd is a local and online party game where 2-4 players compete in fast-paced minigames. Herd sheep, cast spells, and sabotage your friends to claim victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spells:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 3 of the 9 available spells to take into the minigame gauntlet. Experiment to discover the best combos and counters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind: Blast away dogs and sheep alike with a powerful gust of wind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block: Barricade goals or paths with an impenetrable wall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm: Attract all nearby sheep instead of scaring them away for a short time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confuse: Invert the controls for all nearby opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Up: Increase your movement speed and zoom around the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Down: Decrease movement speed for nearby opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine: Place down a trap that will blow away everything when it gets triggered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun: Zap nearby players and stop them from moving for a bit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow: Increase your size as well as your ability to move sheep.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigames:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shepherding: Collect more sheep into your pen than your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer: Keep the ball (sheep) out of your own goal while trying to score on your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race: Get your sheep over the finish line\u00a0before  anyone else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King of the Hill: Herd your sheep onto the hill to claim ownership and earn more points than your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor is Lava: Maneuver your sheep off of the falling tiles and be the last one standing.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a dog. Your entire purpose in life is herding sheep. Other players are also dogs. They also want to herd sheep. They want to herd more sheep than you. <i>You will not let that happen.\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wiz-Herd is a local and online party game where 2-4 players compete in fast-paced minigames. Herd sheep, cast spells, and sabotage your friends to claim victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spells:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 3 of the 9 available spells to take into the minigame gauntlet. Experiment to discover the best combos and counters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind: Blast away dogs and sheep alike with a powerful gust of wind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block: Barricade goals or paths with an impenetrable wall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm: Attract all nearby sheep instead of scaring them away for a short time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confuse: Invert the controls for all nearby opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Up: Increase your movement speed and zoom around the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Down: Decrease movement speed for nearby opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine: Place down a trap that will blow away everything when it gets triggered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun: Zap nearby players and stop them from moving for a bit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow: Increase your size as well as your ability to move sheep.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigames:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shepherding: Collect more sheep into your pen than your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer: Keep the ball (sheep) out of your own goal while trying to score on your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race: Get your sheep over the finish line\u00a0before  anyone else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King of the Hill: Herd your sheep onto the hill to claim ownership and earn more points than your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor is Lava: Maneuver your sheep off of the falling tiles and be the last one standing.</p></li></ul>",
